=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: deleting a runner script is consolidation until proven otherwise
origin: the same carve-out `_is_ci_workflow` already makes for tox.ini and
origin2: setup.cfg — projects move `scripts/test` into `uv run pytest`, and a
origin3: pipeline that calls a deleted script fails loudly rather than silently.
origin4: Reported at warn; a removed *workflow* is still the escalating case.
